* Two-stage fully differential OTA, 180 nm. D G S B ordering.
* Node p corresponds to the positive output for increasing ip-im.
.subckt ota ip im op om vdd 0
Iref vdd b 20u
Mref b b 0 0 nch W=2u L=0.60u
Mtail t b 0 0 nch W=12u L=0.60u
M1 xp ip t 0 nch W=16u L=0.52u
M2 xm im t 0 nch W=16u L=0.52u
M3 xp a vdd vdd pch W=10u L=0.65u
M4 xm a vdd vdd pch W=10u L=0.65u
M5 op xp vdd vdd pch W=30u L=0.65u
M6 om xm vdd vdd pch W=30u L=0.65u
M7 op s 0 0 nch W=14u L=0.55u
M8 om s 0 0 nch W=14u L=0.55u
R1 xp a 800k
R2 xm a 800k
R3 op s 800k
R4 om s 800k
C1 xp a 40f
C2 xm a 40f
C3 op s 40f
C4 om s 40f
Rzp xp zp 620
Rzm xm zm 620
Ccp zp op 220f
Ccm zm om 220f
.ends ota
